<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">I am the wind=92s quiet rebell=
ion,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">a sovereign force wrapped in salt spray and intuition,</d=
iv>
<div dir=3D"auto">moving along edges where maps forget to breathe.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">My home, a sanctuary on wheels,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">traces the contours of cliffs and the pull of the Pacific=
=92s whisper.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I wake with the lighthouses=97</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">their beams cutting truths into the dark,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">my truths, sharp as sea glass</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">but held gently in the palm of the present.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I speak to That Thing,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">the one with no name,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">the one that churns inside the waves and the void of my c=
hest,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">both wild and constant=97</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">both teacher and terrain.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I carry storms in my pocket,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">their gusts tearing through yesterday=92s doubts,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">their rain washing my fears into fertile ground.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">And if I find myself broken down on the 101,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">it will be a baptism in asphalt and ocean spray,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">another chapter where the wind and I rewrite the rules.</=
div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Yes, I long for another sovereign soul,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">a man with eyes like embers,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">who laughs at chaos but holds it tenderly.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Someone who sees me not as a tangle to untie</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">but a current to dive into.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">We=92d carry storms together,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">building lighthouses in the spaces between us.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Until then, I=92ll wander.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Each step a communion,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">each gust a guide,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">each unmarked cove a mirror.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I am not afraid of the dark,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">only of forgetting how to love it.</div>
